      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-07-13T21:38:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>its pretty good against BB too, since the Blade Batallions hit for a nasty 5 damage when they come out.   You can slow them and get a chance to hurt them a bit so they dish out less damage if you have Sub-Zero atmosphere.  It’s one of Zero’s better cards against a lot of villians.</p>\n<p>Although it could concieveably accellerate the Terralunar impulsion beam by a turn,   but that <em>probably</em> isn’t going to happen, right?</p>",
