      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-07-16T21:51:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>After thinking about that, I don’t think Subzero Atmosphere will speed up Blade’s beam.  The effects go in the order written on the card, right?  So first, if he has fifteen cards, game over.  Then you trash a card, due to his advanced text.  Right?</p>",
