      "created_at": "2012-07-16T22:09:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, but that still happens at the end of turn, so it would happen at the beginning instead.</p>\n<p>However, it’s important to note that the effects happen in order they are written; FIRST it checks the deck for 15 cards. THEN it pulls a card into the trash. If this is card 15, then he will win the NEXT turn. Then he plays a card.</p>",
